                "text": "Vulnerability GHSA-8q59-q68h-6hv4\nSeverity: critical\nPackage: pyyaml\nVersion: 5.3.1\nFix Version: 5.4\nType: python\nLocation: /lab5-canary/requirements.txt\nData Namespace: github:language:python\nLink: [GHSA-8q59-q68h-6hv4](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8q59-q68h-6hv4)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability GHSA-8q59-q68h-6hv4**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| critical  | pyyaml  | 5.3.1  | 5.4  | python  | /lab5-canary/requirements.txt  | github:language:python  | [GHSA-8q59-q68h-6hv4](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8q59-q68h-6hv4)  |\n"
